{"data":{"target":{"id":"ENSG00000148737","approvedSymbol":"TCF7L2","functionDescriptions":["Participates in the Wnt signaling pathway and modulates MYC expression by binding to its promoter in a sequence-specific manner. Acts as a repressor in the absence of CTNNB1, and as activator in its presence. Activates transcription from promoters with several copies of the Tcf motif 5'-CCTTTGATC-3' in the presence of CTNNB1. TLE1, TLE2, TLE3 and TLE4 repress transactivation mediated by TCF7L2/TCF4 and CTNNB1. Expression of dominant-negative mutants results in cell-cycle arrest in G1. Necessary for the maintenance of the epithelial stem-cell compartment of the small intestine. {ECO:0000269|PubMed:12408868, ECO:0000269|PubMed:12727872, ECO:0000269|PubMed:19443654, ECO:0000269|PubMed:22699938, ECO:0000269|PubMed:9727977}."],"proteinIds":[{"id":"Q9NQB0","source":"uniprot_swissprot"},{"id":"A0A0A0MTL7","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A0D9SGH8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GU84","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GVE1","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A994J4F0","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A994J711","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"C6ZRJ7","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"C6ZRK5","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"E2GH13","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"E2GH16","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"E2GH18","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"E2GH26","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"H0YEE5","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"Q5JRY3","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"Q5JRY4","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"Q5VVR5","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"Q5VVR7","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"Q5VVR8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"Q6FHW4","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"ENSP00000277945","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000298692","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000344823","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000345640","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000347949","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000348274","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":